
/*!
	the codec protocol in words: x, y, z, support 64 bit aligned frame sizes (please, for speed)
*/

/*!
	structure of every message: m payload items each with a different size n

		.----------------------------------------------------.
		| 32: messageSize                                    |
		| 32: payloadSize                                    |
		| 16: type                                           |
		| 16: extension                                      |
		| 32: token                                          |
		| 8 : header-specified byte                          |
		| 8 : header-specified byte                          |
		| 16: header-specified word                          |
		| 32: header-specified dword                         |
		|   ----------------------------------------------   |
		| 16: payloadItemAmount                              |
		| 16: payloadItemSize   m                            |
		| 16: payloadItemOffset m                            |
		| 16: byte              (4 - (1 + 2 * m) % 4) % 4    |
		| 8 : payloadItem       n                        } m |
		| 8 : byte              (8 - n % 8) % 8          ]   |
		`----------------------------------------------------´
*/



























